   "text": "There's a Watsi patient named Thu Ta that I met, and honestly so many others. Our community came together to fund the heart surgery he needed. When I met him, he crossed the border in a river from Myanmar to Thailand to get care, and today he's helping bring health care back to the people in Myanmar who have nowhere else to turn in the middle of a war, and that's what showing up for one person can become.",
